OL,3,AMoon set to turn red as rare partial
OL,4,Alunar eclipse graces UK skies on Friday
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkywatchers across the UK could get to
OL,7,Fsee a stunning partial lunar eclipse in
OL,8,Fthe early hours of Friday, but cloud
OL,9,Fmay spoil the spectacle for some.
OL,11,FThe Sun, Earth and Moon will line up in
OL,12,Fthe night sky causing the full Moon -
OL,13,Fnicknamed the Sturgeon Moon - to glow
OL,14,Fan eerie red.
OL,16,FIt will occur shortly before moonset
OL,17,Fmeaning it will be low on the horizon,
OL,18,Fwith the Moon appearing bigger and more
OL,19,Fdramatic than usual thanks to a
OL,20,Fphenomenon known as the Moon illusion.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
