OL,3,AMoon set to turn red as rare partial
OL,4,Alunar eclipse graces UK skies on Friday
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever cloud and rain may obscure the
OL,7,Fview for some, with the best viewing
OL,8,Fchances likely to be in the south and
OL,9,Feast of England, and possibly parts of
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland.
